                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This was my first time trying German food in Taiwan, and it turned out to be the perfect choice. Having lived in Germany before, I can say the food here has that authentic, familiar taste.\n\nI especially loved their pork knuckles, and the sauerkraut was just as you’d find in Germany. Another great thing is they serve draft German beer, which isn’t too expensive. It made my night, as I could enjoy a good Weizen beer at a great value. Overall, a fantastic experience :)",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
